<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Money Power Fame - Remastered</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">DON BROCO</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Automatic (Deluxe)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">1Ue0sFVGnKM8N8PUeFYMFW</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.610" end="00:03.830">Get up for the money, for the power, the fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.830" end="00:11.830">We need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.460" end="00:20.360">Get up for the money, for the power, the fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.360" end="00:23.650">Get up for the money, for the power, the feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.650" end="00:25.150">We need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.000" end="00:27.560">Breaking my bones every night and day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.560" end="00:30.000">Breaking my bones, don't care what they say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.000" end="00:32.590">I want, you want, we want more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.590" end="00:34.960">I want, you want, we want more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.960" end="00:37.480">Breaking our bones every night and day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.480" end="00:39.970">Breaking our bones, breaking all the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.970" end="00:42.320">I want, you want, we want more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.320" end="00:44.720">I want more, give me some more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.720" end="00:46.670">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.670" end="00:49.160">Tell me that you feel it, that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.160" end="00:52.240">Takes me on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.240" end="00:57.160">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.160" end="01:02.110">Give me, give me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.110" end="01:07.160">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.160" end="01:09.580">Give me, give me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.580" end="01:12.060">Breathe it in, feed our appetites</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.060" end="01:17.050">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.050" end="01:19.430">Breaking my bones every night and day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.430" end="01:21.940">Breaking my bones, don't care what they say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.940" end="01:24.400">I want, you want, we want more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.400" end="01:26.680">I want, you want, we want more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.680" end="01:29.240">No matter what we've done to get it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.240" end="01:31.890">No matter what the consequences</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.890" end="01:36.730">Give me, give me some more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.730" end="01:38.680">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.680" end="01:41.010">Tell me that you feel it, that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.010" end="01:43.560">Takes me on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.560" end="01:46.650">Takes me on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.650" end="01:48.560">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.560" end="01:51.520">Tell me that you feel it you feel it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.520" end="01:54.150">Breathe it in, feed our appetites</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.150" end="01:59.030">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.030" end="02:03.920">Give me, give me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.920" end="02:08.940">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.940" end="02:11.400">Give me, give me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.400" end="02:13.910">Breathe it in, feed our appetites</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.910" end="02:16.710">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.710" end="02:19.820">Get up for the money, for the power, the fame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.820" end="02:23.830">I need it take me on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.830" end="02:26.590">On and on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.590" end="02:29.690">Get up for the money, for the power, the feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.690" end="02:33.770">I need it take me on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.770" end="02:36.150">On and on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:36.150" end="02:38.000">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:38.000" end="02:40.430">Tell me that you feel it, that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:40.430" end="02:42.940">Takes me on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.940" end="02:46.060">Takes me on and on and on</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.060" end="02:47.890">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:47.890" end="02:50.980">Tell me that you feel it, you feel it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:50.980" end="02:53.400">Breathe it in 'til we're satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.400" end="02:55.990">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.990" end="03:00.860">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:00.860" end="03:03.640">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:03.640" end="03:05.890">Feel it, you feel it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.890" end="03:08.690">Feeling that feeling</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:08.690" end="03:10.730">Feel it, feel it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:10.730" end="03:13.200">Breathe it in 'til we're satisfied</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.200" end="03:16.050">Breathe it in, yeah, we need it, need it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:16.050" end="03:20.050" /></div></body></tt>